Not bundled
===========

Chez Scheme (https://github.com/cisco/ChezScheme) is required to run the
server and is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. libuv
(https://github.com/libuv/libuv, MIT License) and, for the docs site alone,
cmark-gfm (https://github.com/github/cmark-gfm, the BSD 2-Clause License,
with parts under the other permissive licenses its COPYING lists) are the
system libraries the build links or loads. None is included in this
repository, and the build bundles none of them.


